nsurance amount so that it is equal to the amount of the deductible and pay the difference to the service provider.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2026-08-31T22:05:45Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"To amend title XVIII of the Social Security Act to limit the coinsurance amount for certain services furnished in an ambulatory surgical center.","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-08-31T22:06:12Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-08-31T22:06:12Z"}
